ERROR:  paimon_slot: column "g" of public.gc_stored is a generated column, which logical replication does not carry
HINT:  paimon_pub does not publish generated columns, so Paimon would hold NULL there for every row; drop the expression (ALTER COLUMN ... DROP EXPRESSION) or leave the column out of the replicated table
