ERROR:  paimon_slot: table name "id/x" cannot be a Paimon table name
HINT:  Paimon reads "$" as a system-table suffix, ":" as a URI scheme, and "/", "." and ".." as paths in the warehouse; rename the table before paimon.add_table() (a later RENAME TO does not change the Paimon name)
SELECT paimon.add_table('"."'::regclass);                                       -- expect ERROR
ERROR:  paimon_slot: table name "." cannot be a Paimon table name
HINT:  Paimon reads "$" as a system-table suffix, ":" as a URI scheme, and "/", "." and ".." as paths in the warehouse; rename the table before paimon.add_table() (a later RENAME TO does not change the Paimon name)
SELECT paimon.add_table('".."'::regclass);                                      -- expect ERROR
ERROR:  paimon_slot: table name ".." cannot be a Paimon table name
HINT:  Paimon reads "$" as a system-table suffix, ":" as a URI scheme, and "/", "." and ".." as paths in the warehouse; rename the table before paimon.add_table() (a later RENAME TO does not change the Paimon name)
SELECT paimon.add_table('sys.t'::regclass);                                     -- expect ERROR
ERROR:  paimon_slot: schema name "sys" cannot be a Paimon database name
